{"sections":[{"slug":"Eilenberg–MacLane空间","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Eilenberg–MacLane空间"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Eilenberg–MacLane 对象"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对正整数</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">与群</span> $G$ (<span lang=\"zh\">当</span> $n&gt;1$ <span lang=\"zh\">时要求为</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>), Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">空间</span> $K(G,n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是同伦等价意义下唯一以</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(n-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">空间</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span> <strong>Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是指</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">带点</span></strong> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(n-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span> Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">对象的范畴为</span> $\\mathsf{EM}_n(\\mathcal C) = \\mathcal C_{*/}^{\\geq n,\\leq n}$.</p>\n<p>Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span> $(X,*)$ <span lang=\"zh\">被它的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶同伦群</span> $\\pi_n(X,*)$ <span lang=\"zh\">唯一决定</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">证明见后文</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">注</span></strong>. Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">对象的定义中</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">带点</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">条件很重要</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">不带点的</span> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(n-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对象称为</span> $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/束","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>"}},{"Plain":" (gerbe).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/LurieHTT","text":"HTT 7.2.2.12"}},{"Plain":").\n<span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子</span>\n$$\r\n\\pi_n = \\tau_{\\leq 0}\\circ \\Omega^n \\colon \\mathcal C_{*/} \\to (\\mathcal C_{*/})_{\\leq 0}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">那么</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $n=0$, $\\pi_0$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出了等价</span> $\\mathsf{EM}_0(\\mathcal C)\\simeq \\mathcal C_{*/}^{\\leq 0}$;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $n=1$, $\\pi_1$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出了等价</span> $\\mathsf{EM}_1(\\mathcal C)\\simeq \\mathsf{Grp}(\\mathcal C_{\\leq 0})$;</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $n\\geq 2$, $\\pi_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出了等价</span> $\\mathsf{EM}_n(\\mathcal C)\\simeq \\mathsf{Ab}(\\mathcal C_{\\leq 0})$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">在等价</span>\n$$\r\n\\Omega^n \\colon \\mathcal C_{*/}^{\\geq n} \\simeq \\mathsf{Grp}_{\\mathbb E_n}(\\mathcal C)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">两边的子范畴</span> $\\mathsf{EM}_n(\\mathcal C)$ <span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $\\mathsf{Grp}_{\\mathbb E_n}(\\mathcal C_{\\leq 0})$ <span lang=\"zh\">相对应</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记上述等价的逆为</span> $K(-,n)$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">推论</span></strong>. Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span> $K(A,n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}^n A$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">一维</span> CW <span lang=\"zh\">复形</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一维</span> CW <span lang=\"zh\">复形是</span> $K(G,1)$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为其基本群</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">射影空间</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathbb{R}P^\\infty$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $K(\\mathbb{Z}_2,1)$.</li>\n<li>$\\mathbb{C}P^\\infty$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $K(\\mathbb{Z},2)$.</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}